      "statement": "PrefMoE improves preference-sensitive personalization while reducing preference collapse in multi-user MLLMs.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "PrefMoE decomposes preferences into shared prototypes and personalized residuals using LoRA adaptation paths.",
